  <title>Cuatro Amigos (four friends)</title>

  <page>
    <title>The Cuatro Amigos Game!</title>

    <!-- Widths are proportional to each portrait's aspect ratio (w/h), so all four
         render at the same height (39.7% of the text width): 1024x778, 500x750,
         413x546, 953x631. Row 1's panels are narrower than row 2's, so its margins
         are widened to center it and keep both rows' 6% column gap equal. -->
    <sidebyside widths="52.3% 26.5%" margins="7.6% 7.6%" valign="top">
      <stack>
        <p>1. Axel</p>
        <image source="cuatroAmigos-friends-axel.jpg">
          <shortdescription>Grayscale portrait of a boy with an afro, outdoors in a park.</shortdescription>
        </image>
      </stack>
      <stack>
        <p>2. Ben</p>
        <image source="cuatroAmigos-friends-ben.jpg">
          <shortdescription>Grayscale portrait of a smiling boy with dark fringe, looking down.</shortdescription>
        </image>
      </stack>
    </sidebyside>

    <sidebyside widths="30.0% 60.0%" margins="2% 2%" valign="top">
      <stack>
        <p>3. Cora</p>
        <image source="cuatroAmigos-friends-cora.jpg">
          <shortdescription>Grayscale portrait of a smiling girl with curled hair and a lace blouse.</shortdescription>
        </image>
      </stack>
      <stack>
        <p>4. Dana</p>
        <image source="cuatroAmigos-friends-dana.jpg">
          <shortdescription>Grayscale portrait of a smiling girl with long wavy hair, outdoors by a river.</shortdescription>
        </image>
      </stack>
    </sidebyside>

    <p>Create a world for these 4 friends<ellipsis/>
      <ul>
        <li><p>How do they know each other?</p></li>
        <li><p>How did they meet?</p></li>
        <li><p>What do they like to do together?</p></li>
      </ul>
    </p>
    <p>Add anything else to the story about these friends!</p>
    <p>Now: let's play a quick thinking game! (Wait for instructions)</p>
  </page>

